{"id":"m4-405","m":4,"paper":"2024年江苏名校优生选调素质测试（网友回忆版）","region":"选调","year":2024,"q":3,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"19591640","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"-1，3，7，15，39，135，（    ）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"387"},{"k":"B","t":"475"},{"k":"C","t":"529"},{"k":"D","t":"615"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"观察数列无明显特征，考虑多级数列。后项-前项得到新数列：4，4，8，24，96，（    ），有明显倍数关系，考虑作商，新数列后项÷前项得到数列：1，2，3，4，（    ），是自然数列，下一项为5，则新数列下一项为96×5=480，故所求项为135+480=615。\n故正确答案为D。"},{"n":2,"qid":"19591637","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"5.2，7.3，10.4，14.6，20.8，（    ）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"26.56"},{"k":"B","t":"28.12"},{"k":"C","t":"37.43"},{"k":"D","t":"39.75"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"观察数列，各项均为小数，优先考虑机械划分。整数部分和小数部分分开看无规律，考虑整体看。观察发现，后一项整数部分=前一项整数部分+前一项小数部分，则所求项整数部分为20+8=28；后一项小数部分=前一项整数部分-前一项小数部分，则所求项小数部分为20-8=12。故题干所求项为28.12。\n故正确答案为B。"},{"n":3,"qid":"19591647","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b43187266a08cc94.png\" />，8，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-86bc139c88b997dd.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f97f160d11eaef06.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c799c20ff10ffe2e.png\" />，（    ）</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9a4dc6f140ff111c.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-371488d07392cdcf.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-24b4e71d3798f4aa.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-878c9477cd2aabb7.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>观察数列特征，有整数和根号，优先考虑机械划分。将原数列统一形式，可转化为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b43187266a08cc94.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a22018d68433341e.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-86bc139c88b997dd.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f97f160d11eaef06.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c799c20ff10ffe2e.png\" />，（    ）。整数部分为：2，4，7，11，16，（    ），无明显规律，考虑作差，后项减前项得到新数列：2，3，4，5，（    ），是连续自然数列，则新数列下一项为6，故所求项的整数部分应为16+6=22；根号内部分为：2，4，6，8，10，（    ），是公差为2的等差数列，则所求项的根号内部分应为10+2=12，故所求项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a42a4d601421b92d.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"}]}]}